{"c":{"281394":["Chris Redgrave","Male","b281394-5INtkodNqBel.png","Chris Redgrave is a member of High Card. He is a flirty, street-smart man who knows his way around women. He is able to operate any vehicle, including cars, with his unmatched driving skills.",166],"281395":["Finn Oldman","Male","b281395-oZ1BljLkfuCU.jpg","Finn is a recently scouted member of High Card. He is a mischievous, spirited, and reckless young man. Born with nerves of steel, Finn is able to maintain his cool disposition in even the most nerve-racking situations.",187],"281396":["Bernard Simmons","Male","b281396-v9Q1rDXXeyFH.png","",14],"281397":["Wendy Satou","Female","b281397-RuxEQEdFSipc.jpg","Wendy is a member of High Card, becoming a member of the society through the connections she had from her father, a master swordsman. She is often serious and is therefore frustrated by the way Finn and Chris work.",109],"281398":["Vijay Singh","Male","b281398-YsxhcXBl1TBm.jpg","Vijay Kumar Singh is a member of High Card. He has a calm personality, loves plants, and is a great chef.",52],"281399":["Theodore Pinochle","Male","b281399-n0JHFICwOnRn.jpg","",8],"281400":["Leo Pinochle","Male","b281400-uj2ZfB5hr33g.jpg","Son of Theodore Constantine Pinochle, manager of Pinochle’s Old Maid branch, and the leader of the High Card society. Possessing a king’s temperament, Leo is sharp tongued, sadistic, and unable to admit to his faults.",86],"286596":["Owen Alldays","Male","b286596-EC8BYGbz3kQS.jpg","",7],"290596":["Ban Klondike","Male","b290596-bEGHBlKHu9T3.png","",5],"290597":["TILT","Male","b290597-rt266lZEJOX4.jpg","",19],"290598":["Bobby Ball","Male","b290598-5TGwxo8olZfh.jpg","",7],"292225":["Greg Young","Male","b292225-2ATl9Hlqx1Fo.png","",2],"292226":["Sugar Pease","Female","b292226-LKAX6I2XYgD4.png","",10],"295091":["Blist Blitz Broadhurst","Male","b295091-4ty5YU2aIVKm.png","Blist is a member of Who's Who Inc and one of Norman's private secretaries and bodyguards. He is straight-laced, serious, and pragmatic to the extreme, constantly nagging Norman about overtime pay, hazard pay, and work regulations.",2],"295092":["Norman Kingstadt",null,"b295092-Rq3nhxy2Laok.jpg","",2],"295093":["Brandy Blumenthal","Female","b295093-xoRNrILxrhAf.png","",1],"295098":["Lindsay Betts","Male","b295098-rygXjqloelEF.png","",5],"295099":["Lucky Lunchman","Male","b295099-3gWmror9Eae0.jpg","",1],"296371":["Julius Fourland",null,"b296371-5C6UxD5uCbwA.jpg","",0],"296372":["Shinka",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296868":["Robert Thousand","Male","b296868-Nd92SbJhxPgQ.jpg","",1],"296870":["Keikan A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296871":["Keikan B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296873":["Bijo","Female","b296873-AMznVWO1d3Wr.jpg","",0],"296874":["Masked Man",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296885":["Eihei A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296886":["Eihei F",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296887":["Eihei E",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296888":["Kodomo C",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296889":["Kodomo A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296890":["Eihei B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296891":["Eihei C",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296892":["Kodomo B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"296893":["Eihei D",null,"default.jpg","",0],"297321":["Nix","Female","b297321-XKdTmMzmTcyD.jpg","",0],"297323":["Carter","Male","b297323-aYkWJ1A4rpjo.jpg","",0],"297324":["Jake","Male","b297324-ChmhfcedlEjm.jpg","",0],"297327":["Iris Moise","Female","b297327-VzQWkuAVDHo0.jpg","",1],"297329":["Keisatsukan",null,"default.jpg","",0],"297330":["Yajiuma",null,"default.jpg","",0],"297331":["Keiji",null,"default.jpg","",0],"297719":["John Doe","Male","b297719-FDsgKavtBxhY.jpg","",1],"297720":["Douglas Buttercup","Male","b297720-8FuZIGVbvkqh.jpg","",1],"297721":["Apple Link","Male","b297721-JzggpSuk5jfq.jpg","CEO of the IT firm Mizerka",1],"297722":["Dansei",null,"default.jpg","",0],"297723":["Jirou Satou","Male","b297723-CwM8VSPHk6TB.jpg","Father of Wendy Satou.",0],"297724":["Wakamono",null,"default.jpg","",0],"298122":["Oliver",null,"b298122-fqbkNHxYaR8G.png","",1],"29